### ========================================================
### 1. REGISTRASI & LOGIN (MENDAPATKAN TOKEN JWT)
### ========================================================

### 1.1 Registrasi Toko Kopi Nusantara (SELLER)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Toko Kopi Nusantara",
  "email": "kopinusantara@mail.com",
  "password": "rahasiaKopi123",
  "role": "SELLER"
}

### 1.2 Registrasi Budi Santoso (BUYER)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Budi Santoso",
  "email": "budi@mail.com",
  "password": "passwordBudi123",
  "role": "BUYER"
}

### 1.3 Login Toko Kopi Nusantara (Ambil Token JWT SELLER)
# @name loginSeller
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "kopinusantara@mail.com",
  "password": "rahasiaKopi123"
}

### 1.4 Login Budi Santoso (Ambil Token JWT BUYER)
# @name loginBuyer
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "budi@mail.com",
  "password": "rahasiaKopi123"
}


### ========================================================
### 2. UJI COBA OTENTIKASI UPLOAD PRODUK DENGAN TOKEN BEARER
### ========================================================

### 2.1 UJI COBA 1: Upload Produk TANPA Token
# Ekspektasi: 403 Forbidden (Ditolak otomatis oleh Spring Security)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kopi Ilegal",
  "description": "Upload tanpa token",
  "price": 50000.0,
  "stock": 10,
  "category": "Minuman"
}

### 2.2 UJI COBA 2: Upload Produk DENGAN Token SELLER Otomatis
# Ekspektasi: 201 Created! (Token diambil otomatis dari response loginSeller di atas)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginSeller.response.body.token}}

{
  "name": "Kopi Flores Bajawa",
  "description": "Biji kopi single origin premium 250g",
  "price": 95000.0,
  "stock": 30,
  "category": "Minuman"
}

### 2.3 Lihat Katalog Produk (Publik)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products?page=0&size=10


### ========================================================
### 3. UJI COBA CACHING (@Cacheable & @CacheEvict)
### ========================================================

### 3.1 Request Pertama: Ambil Detail Produk ID 1 (Cache MISS)
# Di terminal console server akan muncul log:
# ">>> [LOG QUERY SQL] Mengambil produk ID 1 dari Database SQL..."
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/1

### 3.2 Request Kedua: Ambil Detail Produk ID 1 LAGI (Cache HIT)
# Perhatikan terminal console server:
# TIDAK ADA log query SQL sama sekali! Respon diambil kilat dari RAM Cache.
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/1

### 3.3 Update Produk ID 1 (Cache EVICT / Hapus Cache)
# WAJIB membawa Token SELLER (Otomatis dari {{loginSeller.response.body.token}})
# Begitu produk diupdate, cache ID 1 otomatis dibersihkan dari RAM!
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginSeller.response.body.token}}

{
  "name": "Kopi Gayo Arabika Premium (Updated)",
  "description": "Biji kopi sangrai kualitas terbaik 250g",
  "price": 90000.0,
  "stock": 45,
  "category": "Minuman"
}

### 3.4 Request Ketiga setelah Update: Ambil Detail Produk ID 1 Lagi (Cache MISS baru)
# Di terminal console server log query SQL AKAN MUNCUL KEMBALI mengambil data terbaru!
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/1


### ========================================================
### 4. UJI COBA EVENT-DRIVEN ARCHITECTURE (@Async WORKER)
### ========================================================

### 4.1 Checkout Pesanan Menggunakan Token BUYER (Budi Santoso)
# Ekspektasi: Respon 201 Created kembali INSTAN (<50ms)!
# Perhatikan Terminal Console Server:
# Log [ASYNC WORKER] akan muncul berjalan di thread latar belakang (background)
# dan mengirim email invoice setelah 2 detik tanpa membuat request HTTP menunggu.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.token}}

{
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

### 4.2 Cek Riwayat Seluruh Pesanan
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders


### ========================================================
### 5. OBSERVABILITAS & HEALTH CHECK (SPRING BOOT ACTUATOR)
### ========================================================

### 5.1 Cek Kesehatan Server (Database SQL, Disk Space, Status Aplikasi)
# Ekspektasi: 200 OK dengan status "UP" dan detail status database
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### 5.2 Kubernetes Liveness Probe (Apakah Pod Server Masih Hidup?)
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health/liveness

### 5.3 Kubernetes Readiness Probe (Apakah Server Siap Menerima Traffic?)
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health/readiness

### 5.4 Pantau Konsumsi Memori RAM JVM (Heap Memory)
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/metrics/jvm.memory.used

### 5.5 Pantau Database Connection Pool (HikariCP Active Connections)
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/metrics/hikaricp.connections.active

### 5.6 Lihat Daftar Seluruh Metrik Server yang Tersedia
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/metrics



